{"displayStem":"동일 공여자의 T세포를 같은 수로 넣고 두 조건에서 같은 TCR 자극을 가하였다. 두 조건의 세포 회수와 염색 손실은 동일하게 관리했다. 분열 지표는 초기 48시간, 사멸 지표는 72시간에 측정하였다.","notes":[{"kind":"provenance","text":"자료는 독립적으로 작성한 교육용 모의자료이다."}],"evidenceMarkup":["<div class=\"dataset-evidence \"><div class=\"evidence\"><div class=\"measurement-panels\"><figure class=\"measurement-panel\"><figcaption>생존 T세포 회수량</figcaption><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 580 355\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"생존 T세포 회수량。배양 시간 (day)、생존 세포 (×10⁴)\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"580\" height=\"355\" fill=\"white\"></rect><line x1=\"76\" y1=\"45\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"229\" stroke=\"black\"></line><line x1=\"76\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"526\" y2=\"229\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"20\" y=\"25\">생존 세포 (×10⁴)</text><line x1=\"76\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"234\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"76\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0</text><line x1=\"186\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"186\" y2=\"234\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"186\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1</text><line x1=\"296\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"296\" y2=\"234\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"296\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2</text><line x1=\"406\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"406\" y2=\"234\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"406\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\">3</text><line x1=\"516\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"516\" y2=\"234\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"516\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\">4</text><line x1=\"71\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"229\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"65\" y=\"234\" text-anchor=\"end\">0</text><line x1=\"71\" y1=\"185.5\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"185.5\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"65\" y=\"190.5\" text-anchor=\"end\">11.25</text><line x1=\"71\" y1=\"142\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"142\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"65\" y=\"147\" text-anchor=\"end\">22.5</text><line x1=\"71\" y1=\"98.5\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"98.5\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"65\" y=\"103.5\" text-anchor=\"end\">33.75</text><line x1=\"71\" y1=\"55\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"55\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"65\" y=\"60\" text-anchor=\"end\">45</text><polyline points=\"76,190.33333333333334 186,178.73333333333335 296,151.66666666666669 406,116.86666666666666 516,82.06666666666666\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-dasharray=\"none\"></polyline><circle cx=\"76\" cy=\"190.33333333333334\" r=\"2.1\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"186\" cy=\"178.73333333333335\" r=\"2.1\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"296\" cy=\"151.66666666666669\" r=\"2.1\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"406\" cy=\"116.86666666666666\" r=\"2.1\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"516\" cy=\"82.06666666666666\" r=\"2.1\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"85\" cy=\"301\" r=\"3\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><text x=\"97\" y=\"306\">Ⅰ</text><polyline points=\"76,190.33333333333334 186,182.6 296,174.86666666666667 406,178.73333333333335 516,186.46666666666667\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 4\"></polyline><rect x=\"73.9\" y=\"188.23333333333335\" width=\"4.2\" height=\"4.2\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></rect><rect x=\"183.9\" y=\"180.5\" width=\"4.2\" height=\"4.2\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></rect><rect x=\"293.9\" y=\"172.76666666666668\" width=\"4.2\" height=\"4.2\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></rect><rect x=\"403.9\" y=\"176.63333333333335\" width=\"4.2\" height=\"4.2\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></rect><rect x=\"513.9\" y=\"184.36666666666667\" width=\"4.2\" height=\"4.2\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></rect><rect x=\"327\" y=\"298\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></rect><text x=\"342\" y=\"306\">Ⅱ</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"282\" text-anchor=\"middle\">배양 시간 (day)</text></svg></figure></div></div></div>","<div class=\"dataset-evidence \"><div class=\"evidence\"><table><thead><tr><th>항목</th><th>Ⅰ</th><th>Ⅱ</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>48시간 분열지수, 반